====== Comtrend VR-3025un (Jazztel, Spain) ======

{{section>meta:infobox:broadcom_wifi#infobox_for_dataentries&noheader&nofooter&noeditbutton}}

{{section>meta:infobox:broadcom_dsl#infobox_for_dataentries&noheader&nofooter&noeditbutton}}

The VR-3025un was given away with a Jazztel Fibre VDSL2 subscription in Spain (Europe), The device includes a DSL VDSL2/ADSL2+ Modem Combo, Wireless N 802.11/a/b/g/n upto 300 Mbps, 4 Wired/LAN Ethernet Ports.

The VDSL2/ADSL2+ transceiver delivers 100 Mb/s downstream and 50 Mb/s upstream (100 Mb/s upstream with external AFE), enhanced QoS for IPTV video, dual-latency framing, ATM or PTM physical layer, DSL channel bonding, and embedded operations channels for remote management of the CPE. ~ taken from broadcam's website [[https://www.broadcom.com/products/broadband/xdsl/bcm6368#overview]]


